        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "You can easily check whether you have stressed the right words by reading your sentences aloud: as you speak the last few words, raise your voice and tap the table with your fingers. If you've stressed the wrong words, your voice and table thumping will feel wrong. If you've stressed the right words, your voice and table thumping (underlined) will feel right:",
